			"notes": "## 中文\n\n- 新增 NeoForge 1.21.1 专用服务器 companion：在后台采集完整区块并维护独立的服务端 LOD 缓存\n- 新增远程 LOD 传输：客户端与服务器协商协议、限额请求缺失 section，并完成方块/生物群系 ID 映射后写入本地缓存\n- 新增远程缓存一致性处理：服务端合并运行中的区块段变化，发送批量失效通知，客户端删除旧条目并限速重拉\n- 异步区块采集改为先快照 palette、生物群系和光照，避免后台转换读取已变化或已卸载的区块状态\n- 客户端与专用服务器合并为同一个通用 JAR；专服使用不依赖 LWJGL 的 RocksDB 存储，客户端继续保留 LMDB/Zstd 支持\n- 同一个 JAR 通过 Sodium 0.6.13、0.8.12、0.8.13-beta.2，以及 Iris、Iris shaderpack 和 Distant Horizons 客户端启动测试\n- 新增打包后专服启动测试和真实客户端/服务器远程 LOD 往返测试，并补充服务端依赖与产物边界校验\n\n## English\n\n- Added a NeoForge 1.21.1 dedicated-server companion that ingests complete chunks in the background and maintains a separate server-side LOD cache\n- Added remote LOD transfer with protocol negotiation, bounded missing-section requests, block/biome ID remapping, and persistent client caching\n- Added remote cache coherence: the server coalesces live section changes and sends batched invalidations so clients discard stale entries and re-fetch them at a bounded rate\n- Snapshot block palettes, biomes, and lighting before asynchronous chunk conversion to avoid reading changed or unloaded chunk state on worker threads\n- Merged client and dedicated-server distributions into one universal JAR; dedicated servers use RocksDB storage without LWJGL while clients retain LMDB/Zstd support\n- Verified the same JAR with Sodium 0.6.13, 0.8.12, and 0.8.13-beta.2, plus Iris, an Iris shaderpack, and Distant Horizons client smoke tests\n- Added packaged dedicated-server startup testing, a real client/server remote LOD roundtrip, and stricter packaged dependency and server-boundary validation\n\nArtifact:\n- voxy-0.6.0.jar\n- SHA256: ee147bd4214f076642e146f5c161eb6d708f7b3e5726fbf40fb71f742ef4bd43"
		},
