			"notes": "## 中文\n\n- 首次进入世界时按帧预算加载 LOD，减少瞬时卡顿和线程争抢\n- 修复 RocksDB 迭代器、原生资源和文件句柄未正确释放的问题\n- 异步区块摄取任务现在持有世界引用，减少重连和切换世界时的生命周期错误\n- 补充 C2ME 共存说明：单人世界可受益，远程服务器不会直接加速客户端 Voxy\n- 继续支持 Sodium 0.6.13 和 0.8.12；由 GitHub Actions 验证\n\n## English\n\n- Budget initial LOD loading per frame to reduce world-join stalls and thread contention\n- Fix RocksDB iterator, native resource, and file-handle cleanup\n- Retain world references while asynchronous chunk ingest tasks are queued or running\n- Document C2ME coexistence behavior for integrated and remote servers\n- Keep Sodium 0.6.13 and 0.8.12 compatibility verified by GitHub Actions"
		},
