			"notes": "## 中文\n\n- NeoForge 1.21.1 客户端构建，聚焦 LOD 缓存正确性与更安全的 Sodium 区块摄取\n- 当相邻缓存段缺失时，LOD 邻接网格生成改为保守策略，减少远景地形切开/地下结构暴露的问题\n- 跟踪存储缺失的占位段，避免缓存的空占位被当作真实 LOD 数据复用\n- 移植上游安全的区块摄取防护：拒绝过期的客户端区块缓存槽，仅读取活跃的 FULL 区块\n- 新增 Gradle 校验脚本，用于保守邻接网格与安全区块摄取的回归测试\n- GitHub Actions Build 通过 Sodium 0.8.12 和 0.6.13 验证；check-does-build 通过；本地静态校验脚本通过\n\n## English\n\n- NeoForge 1.21.1 client build focused on LOD cache correctness and safer Sodium chunk ingest\n- Made LOD neighbor meshing conservative when adjacent cached sections are missing, reducing distant terrain cutaway / exposed underground artifacts\n- Tracked storage-missing placeholder sections so cached empty placeholders are not reused as real LOD data\n- Ported upstream-safe chunk ingest guards: stale client chunk-cache slots are rejected and ingest only reads live FULL chunks\n- Added Gradle validation scripts for conservative neighbor meshing and safe chunk ingest regressions\n- GitHub Actions Build passed for Sodium 0.8.12 and 0.6.13; check-does-build passed; local static validation scripts passed\n\nArtifact:\n- voxy-0.4.0.jar\n- SHA256: 0834e96bbee9e2bf387337b501826b879cfcf6435243a4dd83cd20c33a6a70ee"
